{"4241940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sundered Soul: Chains of the Undying", "steam_appid": 4241940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Who You Were Meant to Be</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 unique base classes, each offering a distinct combat identity. Evolve your playstyle even further with 18 specialized subclasses, each introducing new mechanics, abilities, and synergies. Master 15 unique weapons - from life-stealing scythes to boomerangs that strike twice - each with their own passives and attack patterns. Whether you're a precise swordsman, an explosive spellcaster, or an agile ranged fighter, every class delivers fresh ways to dominate the battlefield.  Play solo, in local co-op, or online co-op with a friend. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up, Evolve, and Shape Your Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each run by leveling up your character and gaining new strengths. Every 4 levels, select a powerful perk that dynamically alters your playstyle. Perks stack, synergize, and interact with your class and relics, ensuring endless build diversity and that no two runs ever feel the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/da892524e8d0b178959efa104f94d3e4.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/da892524e8d0b178959efa104f94d3e4.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/da892524e8d0b178959efa104f94d3e4.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Across 6 Distinct Acts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a world torn apart by corruption, from eerie cemeteries to enchanted faerie forests, shadowed caves, fortified castles, and hidden criminal hideouts. Each act features its own enemies, hazards, events, and secrets, offering constant variety and challenge with every attempt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/73cfbdb9feb7e3f030dd77a852031823.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/73cfbdb9feb7e3f030dd77a852031823.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/73cfbdb9feb7e3f030dd77a852031823.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek Legendary Treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare relics that dramatically reshape your abilities. Forge unstoppable synergies, break the rules of combat, and grow stronger with each new artifact you uncover as you press deeper into the darkness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/0d05d933ebec48d9447bc0f055bc8ab3.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/0d05d933ebec48d9447bc0f055bc8ab3.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/0d05d933ebec48d9447bc0f055bc8ab3.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger with Permanent Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend gold to unlock persistent upgrades. Enhance your stats, open new strategic options, and expand your arsenal—ensuring steady progress even when defeat comes swiftly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/135d3bf2625092c4b408e3652fb88fe0.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/135d3bf2625092c4b408e3652fb88fe0.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/135d3bf2625092c4b408e3652fb88fe0.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Terrifying Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 23 uniquely crafted bosses, each featuring brutal attack patterns, relentless aggression, and no mercy for the unprepared. These encounters are the ultimate tests of your build, your execution, and your mastery of the game’s mechanics.      <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/ad6c39d31be9eb0460754b50f1ac09d4.avif?t=1782399525\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are only the beginning. The <strong>Arena</strong> pits you against endless waves of enemies, pushing your build to its limits. Or take on the <strong>Hunt.  </strong>Dangerous expeditions where powerful Champions await. Slay them and claim legendary relics as your prize. Victory favors the bold.   <br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/6a6d0dcb4c7f5d2a64e0d56da9182d4b.avif?t=1782399525\" width=1560 height=975 /></span><strong>A World Worth Fighting For</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sundered Soul: Chains of the Undying blends intense action, rewarding progression, and rich atmosphere into a roguelite experience designed for endless replayability. Forge your strength, conquer the darkness, and reclaim what was lost.  Etch your name into the Steam Leaderboards. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/6b2b8bc0bb932bfa3b174a9379961876.avif?t=1782399525\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes, 18 subclasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Local OR Online Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique weapons with distinct passives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12  Miniboss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks with powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic equipment and crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode across 6 acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena mode with endless waves and mutators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt mode with back to back elite bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Cycle difficulty scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud saves, leaderboards, achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizeable UI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Who You Were Meant to Be</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 unique base classes, each offering a distinct combat identity. Evolve your playstyle even further with 18 specialized subclasses, each introducing new mechanics, abilities, and synergies. Master 15 unique weapons - from life-stealing scythes to boomerangs that strike twice - each with their own passives and attack patterns. Whether you're a precise swordsman, an explosive spellcaster, or an agile ranged fighter, every class delivers fresh ways to dominate the battlefield.  Play solo, in local co-op, or online co-op with a friend. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.poster.avif?t=1782399525\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.webm?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241940/extras/7c9abbc2287a0d22ee4bbd5acb688290.mp4?t=1782399525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up, Evolve, and Shape Your Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each run by leveling up your character and gaining new strengths. Every 4 levels, select a powerful perk that dynamically alters your playstyle. Perks stack, synergize, and interact with your class and relics, ensuring endless build diversity a